---
// Decap CMS admin, served as a real Astro route.
//
// Why a route and not a static public/admin/index.html: during `astro dev`,
// browser navigation requests (Accept: text/html) are handled by Astro's
// router, which 404s on static .html files in public/. A real page is served
// correctly in both dev and the production build (emits /admin/index.html).
//
// The CMS config still lives at public/admin/config.yml and is fetched at
// runtime (non-HTML request), so it is served statically without issue.
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <title>Content Editor · hadyelsahar.github.io</title>
    <link href="/admin/config.yml" type="text/yaml" rel="cms-config-url" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <script is:inline src="https://unpkg.com/decap-cms@^3.8.4/dist/decap-cms.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
